




:: eli_closet
<<set $locationName to "Eli's Apartment - Closet">>
<<set $right_sidebar_mode to 0>>
<<set $locationImage to "images/locations/eli_closet.jpeg">>
<img src="images/locations/eli_closet.jpeg" alt="Eli's Closet" style="width:100%; height:auto;">

[[Change Clothes|closet_change]] | [[← Floor Plan|apartment_map]]

:: closet_change

<<set $rand to random(1, 5)>>
<<if $rand is 1>>
<<goto closet_outfit_1>>
<<elseif $rand is 2>>
<<goto closet_outfit_2>>
<<elseif $rand is 3>>
<<goto closet_outfit_3>>
<<elseif $rand is 4>>
<<goto closet_outfit_4>>
<<else>>
<<goto closet_outfit_5>>
<</if>>

:: closet_outfit_1

<img src="images/locations/eli_closet.jpeg" alt="Eli's Closet" style="width:100%; height:auto;">

I pull out the grey hoodie. It's the one I always go back to   slightly worn at the cuffs, a small bleach stain near the pocket that I stopped noticing a long time ago. Dark jeans. The same ones as yesterday, probably.

<<eli "...this works.">>

I pull it on. Nothing fits great. Nothing needs to.

[[← Closet|eli_closet]]

:: closet_outfit_2

<img src="images/locations/eli_closet.jpeg" alt="Eli's Closet" style="width:100%; height:auto;">

There's one clean black t-shirt left. Slightly wrinkled from the drawer but not bad enough to care about. I pair it with sweatpants and call it done.

<<eli "Clean enough.">>

I check myself in the closet mirror for exactly one second. Fine.

[[← Closet|eli_closet]]

:: closet_outfit_3

<img src="images/locations/eli_closet.jpeg" alt="Eli's Closet" style="width:100%; height:auto;">

The navy crewneck I almost never wear. I grab it anyway   it's near the front, which means everything else is either dirty or buried. Worn jeans, the ones with the frayed left knee.

<<eli "...this'll do.">>

A little more put-together than usual. Barely.

[[← Closet|eli_closet]]

:: closet_outfit_4

<img src="images/locations/eli_closet.jpeg" alt="Eli's Closet" style="width:100%; height:auto;">

Nothing looks clean. I sniff a shirt   a plain white one, slightly creased. It passes. I pull it on over boxers and reach for the joggers crumpled on the closet floor.

<<eli "It's fine, nobody's coming over.">>

Good enough for staying in.

[[← Closet|eli_closet]]

:: closet_outfit_5

<img src="images/locations/eli_closet.jpeg" alt="Eli's Closet" style="width:100%; height:auto;">

I dig toward the back and find the olive green jacket I forgot I owned. Throw it over a plain tee. It actually fits okay. Better than okay. I leave the jeans from this morning on   they're still clean enough.

<<eli "...not bad.">>

I almost look like I have somewhere to be.

[[← Closet|eli_closet]]